  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: '<size=22>- All Dollar Bill symbols are Scatters.

      - Wins can occur in any position and are not limited to direction or reel placement.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: <size=22>- Wins can occur in any position and are not limited to direction
      or reel placement.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: '<size=19>- Wild only appears on the center Hexagon position during Base
      Games.


      - Wild substitutes for all symbols except                 .

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=18>5 or more                  during Base Games triggers the Respin
      Bonus.\n\n\n        <b>5</b>                  -  5 Respins\n\n\n        <b>6</b>
      \                 - 7 Respins\n\n\n        <b>7</b>                  - 9 Respins\n\n\n
      \       <b>8</b>                  - 12 Respins\n\n\n        <b>9</b>                  -
      15 Respins"
