    value: "<size=19>- Credit with 0.5x - 5x total bet\r\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_TABLE_5
    value: "<size=19>\n- Credit with 0.5x - 5x total bet\r\n- Multiplier of x2, x3,
