  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=19>- After each respin, if                lands on a position with
      NO               ,  then\n                  appears on that position and the
      value displayed on                   is transferred to                .\r\n\r\n-
      After each respin, if x2, x3, x4, or x5 lands on               , then it multiplies
      the value of                 on that position.\r\n\r\n- After each respin if
      \ +1 Spin lands on                , then it adds 1 spin to total number of respins.
