      awarded.\r\n\r\n- Other symbol pays are not evaluated during the Respin Bonus.\r\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: '<size=18>- 5 or more Bonus symbols triggers the Choose Your Free Games
      bonus.

      - Choose Your Free Games gives 5 bonus options with different Dollar Bill symbols
      and number of free spins.

      - More initial Bonus symbols enables more free spins in the 5 options.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: "<size=18>- During Free Games, 5 or more of the user's selected symbol
      triggers Hold & Re-Spin.\n- During Hold & Re-Spin, all selected Scatter symbol
      will remain locked in place while remaining spots spin.\n- Hold & Re-Spin lasts
      for 3 spins initially. When any additional selected Scatter appears, award +1
      spin.\n- If the selected Scatter fills the entire screen, award Scatter pay
      times 2!"
